<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price of 100.80.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price of 100.80.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said that its auction on Tuesday of 2.6 percent 10-year Japanese government bonds (JGB) produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.80   Stop rate     2.500 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.84   Average yield 2.495 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   3.3271 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	590.8  billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 41.7338 pct  Issue date   Feb 20, 1997   Maturity   Mar 20, 2007</p>
</text>
